usage: verify_maintenance.py [-h] stage

Cold, read-only verification of the NEW populated maintenance exports. Only
the sibling source-pinned producer/parser may supply cases. Each case gets an
owned loopback node and the generic loader stops it in finally. No endpoint,
key, sender-override, send, impersonation or existing-chain option is
accepted. Actual24M/full25% admission is distinct from finite producer
assertions, intended guard refusals and any bounded diagnostic execution. No
running limit changes.

positional arguments:
  stage

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
